Box 48569: an explicit „დაიმახსოვრე როგორც შეთავაზება" got „დავიმახსოვრე
შენი შეთავაზება…" with no tool call, and the offers list stayed empty.
Like 3302's deletions: when the owner's line and the reply both speak of
an offer and the reply says it was saved, but save_offer did not run, the
owner reads the truth and one confirm button; the next run saves it the
ordinary way. A saved profile line is never touched. Server text only; the
model's tool text is unchanged.

